   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "And the UNIQUE constraint is the most important\nline in the schema. A broker supplies its own\nclient_order_id; one that times out and retries\nsends the same one, the second insert violates the\nconstraint, and the existing order is returned.\nWithout it a retried submission becomes A SECOND\nREAL ORDER IN THE BOOK - and a duplicate order that\nfills is a position the client never wanted and is\nlegally obliged to settle. The critical path\nenforces it in memory (the order manager holds the\nday's id set); the constraint is the durable\nbackstop, exactly as the URL shortener keeps a\nunique index it believes can never fire.",
   "originalText": "And the UNIQUE constraint is the most important\nline in the schema. A broker supplies its own\nclient_order_id; one that times out and retries\nsends the same one, the second insert violates the\nconstraint, and the existing order is returned.\nWithout it a retried submission becomes A SECOND\nREAL ORDER IN THE BOOK - and a duplicate order that\nfills is a position the client never wanted and is\nlegally obliged to settle. The critical path\nenforces it in memory (the order manager holds the\nday's id set); the constraint is the durable\nbackstop, exactly as the URL shortener keeps a\nunique index it believes can never fire.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "dn3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 1680,
   "width": 1027,
   "height": 32,
   "strokeColor": "#b45309",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100166,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 701162,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Deliberately absent: nothing on price or quantity - never searched by, only aggregated, and aggregation happens in the columnar\nstore. And no index at all on the event stream, because sequence x 64 byte arithmetic is the index.",
   "originalText": "Deliberately absent: nothing on price or quantity - never searched by, only aggregated, and aggregation happens in the columnar\nstore. And no index at all on the event stream, because sequence x 64 byte arithmetic is the index.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
